name = "Selection for the Twelve Zodiac Signs"
blurb = "A set of 13 prints depicting historical and mythical figures likened to the twelve animals of the zodiac. There is one print for each animal, and an extra print for the tiger.  A tiny image of the animal is found on the edge of each title cartouche."
